flowchart RL
    N0{Report done}
    N1[Load parse]
    N2[Notify notify]
    N3[Retry report]
    N4[/Report emit/]
    N5(Done)
    N6(Check)
    N7[(Check archive)]
    N8(Store retry)
    N0 --> N1
    N1 --> N2
    N2 -->|fail| N3
    N2 --> N4
    N3 --> N5
    N5 -->|next| N6
    N6 --> N7
    N5 --> N8
    N7 --> N8
    N5 --> N0
